WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.505
The Calico's closing.

00:00:01.505 --> 00:00:04.050
Probably not a person in town
that place hasn't touched.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.120
Which means a lot of people
would want to save it.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.500
(SINGING) Back and forth inside
my mind, like an old porch--

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.670
No one really
cares about keeping

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.960
this place open except me.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.030
People do care.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.430
That was so much fun.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:19.200
You'd like Piper if
you gave her a chance.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.990
It's just always been the
two of us against the world.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.860
The world's a tough place.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.130
Isn't it better to have
more people in your corner?

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.280
Let's be the change.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.280
See you real soon.

